imary first, filled in when the list arrives after compose opened; a browser-encrypted send never falls back to the account address for an extra mailbox. With one mailbox and one address the send-as select is shown as before. The compose autosave (`app/draftAutosave.ts`) records the mailbox and From: restoring re-pins compose to that mailbox when it is listed; otherwise the draft is not restored, the notice names its From, and autosave is off for that compose window so the snapshot survives. Attachments of an extra mailbox render as buttons that download through `downloadFile` as `application/octet-stream`, never as links (a link cannot carry the header, so opening or saving it would fetch the primary's file). Settings → Filters names the open mailbox that Run rules now targets.
